    the_rationalisable_sections_on_the_committed_ca..  the count must move with tolerance
    the_cost_coordinate_census_and_its_calibration_..  the pairs must be byte-identical

  REQUIREMENT IMPLICIT IN WHAT THE CLAIM NEEDS (6)
    staged_narrowing_depends_on_its_staging            a True with no witness is impossible
    operation_erasure_holds_at_every_optimisation_l..  the oracles must part below -O2
    one_congruence_property_predicts_every_law_verd..  a yes-everywhere predictor shows as
                                                       conservative mismatches, and the closed
                                                       form is predicted before measuring
    no_conservatism_order_exists_on_the_overflow_axis  the claim needs the two orders to disagree
    the_const_eval_frontier_by_arity                   every refusal must be the step budget
    generating_a_winner_table_from_a_stated_weighting  the table must be stable or nothing generates

  ALREADY CLASSIFIED (1)
    the_width_invariance_control_was_toothless         `defective`, and correctly so

  NEEDED THE INSTRUMENT OPENED (1)
    the_collapsed_declaration_cannot_be_made_to_fail   reading the field could not settle it.
      `73_probes/p1c_output.txt` carries a positive arm the field did not name: the mutation
      set breaks the HONEST declaration's verdicts in 3 of 4 cases, and one of the four is
      labelled the control in the source. So the collapsed column's zeros are a fact about the
      collapsed declaration rather than about a checker that notices nothing. `sound`, and the
      row's `control` field has been amended to name the arm, because a row understating its
      own instrument is the same defect as one overstating it pointed the other way.

SO THE BUCKET EMPTIES, and that is a result about the corpus rather than about
the reading: none of the thirteen turned out to be a row where a control was
neither stated nor implied. The six implicit ones are the real residue and they
are the place a second reader should push, because an implicit requirement is
one nobody wrote down and the next reader has to reconstruct it exactly as I
just did.
